learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T22:18:15.799Z","harness:codex","Graph quality needs a denominator and a semantic numerator: canonical aliasing prevents double counting, while semantic share prevents a dense but algorithmically meaningless related-edge graph from satisfying context guarantees."
